    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n100911" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συνουσι-αστικός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>sociable</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ξυμποτικὸς καὶ ξ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>V.</u>
				1209
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>capable of holding intercourse with</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ ἄνθρωπος . . τῷ θεῷ -κός</span>”
